<p>NOTE: In 1997 Q2 and six months, AMP recorded a litigation reserve of $17.7 million pretax ($0.05 per share) in connection with the IMT/Connectware arbitration decision of July 1, 1997. The decision is now being appealed.</p>
<p>In 1997 Q1, the company's inventory costing methodology changed to include manufacturing engineering costs. Previously, these costs were expensed in the period incurred. In addition, certain capacity assumptions used to determine inventory standard cost were modified to more reflect plant utilization plans. The net effect of these changes is presented as a cumulative effect of accounting changes and results in a one-time benefit.</p>
